{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170488445,"sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","part":{"id":"prt_092df0fd30016mMNypJrJQvopE","messageID":"msg_092df05d4001C2pQ7EcCkAt4eK","sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","type":"text","text":"I’ll inspect the search request handling and existing tests, add a minimal stale-request guard, then run the tests without changing them or installing dependencies.","time":{"start":1789170487251,"end":1789170488442},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0548d2726f9a889c016aa493371d3487d18ddf654022e4ac73","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789170530813,"sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_86Gq4MYibmwHqxhEkELBCRFK","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Locate search implementation","prompt":"Quick exploration: locate search async implementation and existing tests/test commands relevant to stale results/loading/errors race. Read only, no edits. Return file paths and recommendations.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f6d20e531ffeSFtWLLk8Wx6ZAY\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n### Implementation and race risks\n\n- **[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/search/controller.ts:32](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/search/controller.ts#L32)** — Main async search/state implementation. No request identity or stale-response guard:\n  - Success at line 41 can overwrite newer results.\n  - Failure at line 43 can expose an obsolete error.\n  - `finally` at line 45 can clear loading while a newer request remains pending.\n  - Empty input clears state but does not invalidate pending requests, which can later repopulate results/errors.\n- **[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/api/search.ts:11](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/api/search.ts#L11)** — Fetch adapter; encodes queries, throws on non-OK HTTP responses, parses items. No cancellation support.\n- **[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/ui/search-view.ts:10](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/src/ui/search-view.ts#L10)** — Every input event starts a search; renders controller results/loading/errors directly, so overlapping requests expose the controller races.\n\n### Existing coverage and commands\n\n**[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/search.test.ts](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/tests/search.test.ts)** contains four tests:\n- Initial state and empty input — line 10.\n- Ordinary success and query encoding — line 17.\n- Ordinary failure and unsubscribe — line 29.\n- View input, loading/results rendering, listener cleanup — line 43.\n\n**No overlapping-request or out-of-order completion tests currently exist.**\n\n**[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/package.json:5](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/package.json#L5)** defines:\n```sh\nnpm test\n# Equivalent:\nnode --test tests/*.test.ts\n# Specific file:\nnode --test tests/search.test.ts\n```\nRequires Node **24+**; no third-party dependencies.\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. Add deterministic tests using manually controlled promises, not timers:\n   - Start A then B; resolve B then A → B’s results remain.\n   - Settle A while B is pending → loading stays true; stale results/errors remain ignored.\n   - Reject A after B succeeds → no stale error.\n   - Fail B, then resolve A → B’s error/state remains unchanged.\n   - Clear input while A is pending; subsequently resolve or reject A → cleared state remains.\n2. Use a monotonically increasing request ID in the controller, incremented on **every search, including empty input**. Guard success, error, and loading-finalization updates against the current ID.\n3. Preserve intentional behavior documented in **[/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/README.md:7](/private/tmp/handwork-search-benchmark-d5rjswig/3-3-opencode/repo/README.md#L7)**: existing results stay visible during a new search; empty input clears without an HTTP request.\n4. Add one view-level overlapping-request test to verify the loading indicator and error rendering track only the latest search.\n\nRead-only inspection completed; no edits or tests executed.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","sessionId":"ses_f6d20e531ffeSFtWLLk8Wx6ZAY","model":{"modelID":"gpt-6-astra","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Locate search implementation","time":{"start":1789170490065,"end":1789170530810}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0548d2726f9a889c016aa4933862e087d1a8f6c216ac24ea40"}},"id":"prt_092df147c001jZQLauvV3v8ch0","sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","messageID":"msg_092df05d4001C2pQ7EcCkAt4eK"}}
