{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170542133,"sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","part":{"id":"prt_092dfded6001ZXZjYHQzfmVy6B","messageID":"msg_092dfd701001ixASgkxqKSsGKE","sessionID":"ses_f6d20faf0ffeMlzoL19Zt487uW","type":"text","text":"The controller lets every request update state when it settles, including requests made before the query was cleared. I’ll add a request counter that advances on every search, including empty queries, and guard results, errors, and loading updates with it.","time":{"start":1789170540246,"end":1789170542132},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_035c5d34bcdf3a4c016aa4936c334887d1ad3a1b35e2611c5a","phase":"commentary"}}}}
